WEBVTT

00:01:58.959 --> 00:02:02.544
what they see on their screens
and what this work does to them.

00:02:02.887 --> 00:02:07.157
They are forced to use code words
in order to hide who they work for.

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:10.490
They are monitored
by private security firms

00:02:10.514 --> 00:02:14.024
in order to ensure
that they don't talk to journalists.

00:02:14.048 --> 00:02:17.587
And they are threatened by fines
in case they speak.

00:02:18.421 --> 00:02:22.183
All of this sounds
like a weird crime story,

00:02:22.207 --> 00:02:23.537
but it's true.

00:02:23.561 --> 00:02:25.053
These people exist,

00:02:25.633 --> 00:02:29.814
and they are called content moderators.